   241	## 11. State × event
   242	
   243	| Event | What happens |
   244	|---|---|
   245	| Build refusal | the whole build stops; to the council |
   246	| A stored input, template or tool version differs from the manifest | the step refuses; to the council |
   247	| The manifest is re-issued after step 2 | all reader output under the old manifest is void; recorded |
   248	| A session void (tool event, unreadable log, non-zero exit, unparseable) | recorded in `launches.jsonl`; one fresh rerun; a second void makes its questions unresolved |
   249	| An interruption mid-step | the step reruns from its last completed predecessor; outputs are written whole with their sha; a partial output is discarded and recorded |
   250	| An invalid reader row | asked again once; still invalid: unresolved |
   251	| A–B disagree | two third readers |
   252	| A third reader missing or invalid, or ruling "neither" | asked again once, else unresolved; "neither" goes to Alex |
   253	| Alex inactive | the line waits |
   254	| Alex amends | from the closed set, in his words; the page is regenerated and re-signed |
   255	| A question without a choice, or Alex declines | no freeze, nothing scored; recorded |
   256	| The signed reference or the shown-check output fails its sha or shape | scoring stops; to the council |
   257	| A shown-check session failure, invalid packet or split | asked again once, else unresolved, reported apart |
   258	| A defect after the freeze | a dated correction record |
   259	| A later run with other questions | a new gold with its own decision (AGENTS §7.1) |
